{"suttaId":"tha-ap188","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7108,7120],"vripara":"30"},"segments":{"tha-ap188:0.3":"Bodhiupaṭṭhākattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap188:1.1":"“Nagare rammavatiyā, āsiṃ murajavādako;","tha-ap188:1.3":"Niccupaṭṭhānayuttomhi, gatohaṃ bodhimuttamaṃ.","tha-ap188:2.1":"“Sāyaṃ pātaṃ upaṭṭhitvā, sukkamūlena codito;","tha-ap188:2.3":"Aṭṭhārasakappasate, duggatiṃ nupapajjahaṃ.","tha-ap188:3.1":"“Pannarase kappasate, ito āsiṃ janādhipo;","tha-ap188:3.3":"Murajo [damatho (syā.)] nāma nāmena, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap188:4.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap188:5.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā bodhiupaṭṭhāko thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap188:6.1":"Bodhiupaṭṭhākattherassāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
